╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  20. CÒN THIẾU SO VỚI ENSOULSHARP SDK (ƯU TIÊN #2)                      ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
Source so sánh: EnsoulSharp.SDK/Core/Wrappers/

[  ] 20.1 Items.h — Item Wrapper (MEDIUM priority)
         Source: EnsoulSharp.SDK/Core/Wrappers/Items.cs
         Cần:
         - HasItem(itemId) — check player có item
         - GetItem(itemId) — get item slot info (cooldown, charges)
         - UseItem(itemId, target?) — cast item active (spoof_call)
         - GetItemCooldown(itemId) — remaining CD
         - CanUseItem(itemId) — ready check
         - ItemId enum đã có trong Enums.h, GetItems() đã có trong DamageCalc.h
         - Chỉ cần tạo file sdk/Wrappers/Items.h wrapper riêng
         Target: sdk/Wrappers/Items.h

[  ] 20.2 Map.h — Map Wrapper (LOW priority)
         Source: EnsoulSharp.SDK/Core/Wrappers/Map.cs
         Cần:
         - GetMapType() — SummonersRift, ARAM, TFT, etc.
         - IsOnSummonersRift(), IsOnHowlingAbyss()
         - MapBounds — min/max coordinates per map
         - SpawnPoints — team spawn positions
         - JungleCampPositions — static camp positions per map
         - Data: sdk/Data/Map.json (đã có)
         Target: sdk/Wrappers/Map.h

[  ] 20.3 Spell Tracker — Skillshot Detection Engine (MEDIUM — cho Evade)
         Source: EnsoulSharp.SDK/Core/Wrappers/Spells/Tracker/
         Cần:
         - Detector.cs → detect new skillshots from SpellCast + Missile events
         - Tracker.cs → manage active skillshots list, update positions, expire
         - ActiveSkillshot struct: Entry, StartPos, EndPos, StartTime, Polygon
         - GetActiveSkillshots() — list tất cả skillshots đang bay
         - IsInDanger(position, radius) — check vị trí có nguy hiểm
         - SpellTypes.h đã có SkillshotTracker foundation
         Target: sdk/Wrappers/Spells/Tracker/SpellTracker.h

[  ] 20.4 OrbwalkerSelector — Mode selection system (LOW priority)
         Source: EnsoulSharp.SDK/Core/Wrappers/Orbwalking/OrbwalkerSelector.cs
         Hiện tại: logic gộp trong Orbwalker.h
         Cần riêng nếu muốn hỗ trợ custom orbwalker modes từ plugins
         Target: sdk/Wrappers/Orbwalking/OrbwalkerSelector.h

[  ] 20.5 TargetSelector Weights — Chi tiết weight system (LOW priority)
         Source: EnsoulSharp.SDK/Core/Wrappers/TargetSelector/Modes/Weights/
         Hiện tại: 1 file gộp (TargetSelector.h), weighted scoring simplified
         EnsoulSharp có 12 individual weight items riêng:
         - AbilityPower, AttackDamage, CrowdControl, FocusMe, Gold,
           Killable, LowHealth, LowResists, ShortDistanceCursor,
           ShortDistancePlayer, TeamFocus, Aggro
         - IWeightItem interface, WeightItemWrapper
         - TargetSelectorDrawing, Humanizer, Selected, Mode system
         Priority LOW vì logic cơ bản đã đủ cho scripts

