==============================================================================
  FILE MAP — Tất cả SDK files (sau restructure 2026-03-06)
==============================================================================

  core/
    Globals.h             — Memory read/write helpers
    Offsets.h             — All game memory offsets (hotfix 2026-03-05)
    Vector.h              — Vec2/Vec3/Vec4 math

  sdk/                    — Root (3 files)
    SDK.h                 — Master include (includes tất cả subdirectories)
    Enums.h               — All SDK enums (50+ enums)
    Game.h                — Game state (time, ping, chat/shop/focus)

  sdk/GameObjects/        — Game object wrappers (7 files)
    GameObject.h          — Core game object wrapper (850+ lines)
    SpellBook.h           — Spell system (SpellSlot, SpellData, SpellBook)
    BuffManager.h         — Buff system (HasBuff, HasBuffOfType)
    AiManager.h           — AI pathfinding (waypoints, nav mesh)
    Missile.h             — Projectile tracking
    ObjectManager.h       — Object iteration
    GameObjects.h         — Cached object lists (heroes, minions, turrets)

  sdk/Events/             — Event detection system (7 files)
    EventSystem.h         — Game event callbacks (6 event types)
    Gapcloser.h           — Gapcloser detection (JSON + 50+ entries)
    InterruptableSpell.h  — Interruptable spell detection (29+ entries)
    Dash.h                — Dash detection (AiManager polling)
    Stealth.h             — Stealth detection (IsVisible polling)
    TurretAggro.h         — Turret aggro tracking
    Teleport.h            — Teleport/Recall tracking (9 types)

  sdk/Math/               — Math, geometry, prediction (6 files)
    Polygon.h             — Polygon system (8 classes + GeometryAdv + ConvexHull)
    Prediction.h          — Movement/skillshot prediction + HitChance
    Cluster.h             — AoE prediction (Circle MEC, Line, Cone)
    GamePath.h            — Path history tracker (MeanSpeed, juking)
    Collisions.h          — Collision detection (WindWall, minion, hero)
    MathUtils.h           — CutPath, GetWaypoints, PositionAfter

  sdk/Wrappers/Damages/   — Damage calculations (4 files)
    DamageCalc.h          — Damage calculations (physical/magic/true/items)
    DamageLibrary.h       — Per-champion QWER damage (JSON, 140+ champs)
    DamagePassives.h      — 60+ champion passive on-hit damages
    DamageMastery.h       — Rune/Keystone damage + multipliers (S26)

  sdk/Wrappers/Spells/    — Spell system (7 files)
    SpellCaster.h         — High-level spell casting with prediction
    SpellTypes.h          — Skillshot subclasses + SkillshotTracker
    SpellDatabase.h       — Spell database class (nlohmann/json)
    SpellDatabaseEntry.h  — Spell data struct (30+ fields)
    LastCast.h            — Last spell cast tracking
    LastCastedSpellEntry.h — Last cast entry data
    LastCastPacketSentEntry.h — Last cast packet data

  sdk/Wrappers/Orbwalking/ — Orbwalker system (2 files)
    Orbwalker.h           — Auto-attack and movement logic
    HealthPrediction.h    — Future health prediction

  sdk/Wrappers/TargetSelector/ — Target selection (1 file)
    TargetSelector.h      — Target priority selection + weighted scoring

  sdk/UI/                 — User interface (4 files)
    MenuUI.h              — Menu system + PermaShow + MenuButton + Notifications
    Drawing.h             — W2S + DrawPolygon/DamageBar/Minimap/Line3D/Sector
    ConfigManager.h       — INI config save/load
    KeyConvert.h          — VK code to display name

  sdk/Utils/              — Utility classes (13 files)
    AutoAttackUtil.h      — AA reset/detect/range (45+ resets)
    AutoLevel.h           — Auto skill level-up (spoof_call)
    CursorUtils.h         — Cursor tracking, IsOverHUD, FakeClick
    DelayAction.h         — Delayed action queue (thread-safe)
    ActionQueue.h         — Conditional action queue
    Invulnerable.h        — Invulnerable database (20+ entries)
    JungleUtils.h         — Jungle classification (type, dragon)
    Logging.h             — Debug logging (5 levels + file)
    MinionUtils.h         — Minion classification (type, pet, clone)
    RecallTracker.h       — Enemy recall detection
    SummonerTracker.h     — Enemy summoner spell CD tracking
    TickOperation.h       — Throttled periodic execution
    WeightedRandom.h      — Gaussian random for humanizer

  sdk/Data/               — Data files (9 JSON files)
    Database.json         — 700KB spell database (613 entries, 157 champions)
    Gapclosers.json       — Gapcloser spells database
    InterruptableSpells.json — Interruptable spells database
    GlobalInterruptableSpellsList.json — Global interruptable spells
    Priority.json         — Champion priority data
    Map.json              — Map data
    9.7.269.2391.json     — Per-champion QWER damage data (main)
    6.6.json              — Per-champion damage data (patch 6.6)
    6.7.json              — Per-champion damage data (patch 6.7)

  plugins/
    IPlugin.h             — Plugin interface
    PluginManager.h       — Plugin lifecycle manager
    awareness/Awareness.h — ESP/Awareness plugin
    core/OrbwalkerPlugin.h    — Orbwalker as core plugin
    core/TargetSelectorPlugin.h — TargetSelector as core plugin

  menu/
    BGXMenu.h             — BGX-style cascading menu
    MenuConfig.h          — Menu configuration

  ─── Tổng: 54 .h + 9 .json = 63 files trong 11 subdirectories ───

==============================================================================
  GHI CHÚ
==============================================================================
- Khi port từ C# → C++: EnsoulSharp SDK types map:
    AIHeroClient    → SDK::GameObject (filtered hero)
    AIMinionClient  → SDK::GameObject (filtered minion)
    SpellType (ES)  → SDK::SpellType (comprehensive, Enums.h)
    SpellType (old) → SDK::SpellCasterType (simple, SpellCaster.h)
    CollisionableObjects → SDK::CollisionableObjects (Enums.h, flags)
    CastType        → SDK::CastType (Enums.h)
    SpellTags       → SDK::SpellTags (Enums.h)
    SpellDatabase   → SDK::SpellDatabase (Wrappers/Spells/SpellDatabase.h)
    SpellDatabaseEntry → SDK::SpellDatabaseEntry (Wrappers/Spells/SpellDatabaseEntry.h)

- Spoof_call PHẢI được dùng cho mọi game function call (anti-cheat)
- __try/__except CHỈ dùng trong hàm KHÔNG có C++ objects → dùng try/catch(...)
- Item IDs cần verify từ Data Dragon / game memory (⏳ pending)
- Champion passive buff names cần verify in-game (⏳ pending)
- Database.json: 613 entries, 157 champions (nlohmann/json, ✅ DONE)

- SO SÁNH ENSOULSHARP (2026-03-06):
    EnsoulSharp: 265 .cs files (Core/) — C# scripting platform
    NightSharp:   54 .h files (sdk/)  — C++ internal SDK
    Feature coverage: ~82%
    Không cần port (C#-specific): BinarySerializer, DynamicInitializer,
      IFilter, JsonFactory, ResourceFactory/Loader/Attribute, Storage,
      Render, WindowsKeys, Signals (EventSystem thay thế)
    Chỉ có C++ SDK (không có EnsoulSharp): AiManager, BuffManager,
      Missile, ObjectManager, SpellBook, AutoLevel, spoof_call,
      direct memory access, ConfigManager (INI)
